msgstr "+ Sprache hinzufügen …"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:191
msgid "Use Swiss set (DE-CH, EN-UK, FR, IT)"
msgstr "Schweizer Set verwenden (DE-CH, EN-UK, FR, IT)"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:216
msgid "Every text is translated once per language and then stored, so later page views cost nothing. You can correct any translation afterwards."
msgstr "Jeder Text wird pro Sprache einmal übersetzt und gespeichert – spätere Seitenaufrufe kosten nichts. Jede Übersetzung lässt sich nachträglich korrigieren."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:222
msgid "Free · no key · instant"
msgstr "Kostenlos · ohne Schlüssel · sofort"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:222
msgid "Works out of the box. Solid quality for most texts. Unofficial free service: Google may slow down very busy servers; translations then continue in the background."
msgstr "Funktioniert sofort. Solide Qualität für die meisten Texte. Inoffizieller Gratisdienst: Google kann sehr aktive Server bremsen; die Übersetzung läuft dann im Hintergrund weiter."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:223
msgid "Best quality · recommended"
msgstr "Beste Qualität · empfohlen"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:223
msgid "Natural, on-brand copy written like a native copywriter, with the whole page as context and your tone instructions. Needs an Anthropic API key (pay per use, each text only once)."
msgstr "Natürliche, markengerechte Texte wie von einer muttersprachlichen Texterin – mit der ganzen Seite als Kontext und Ihren Tonalitäts-Vorgaben. Benötigt einen Anthropic-API-Schlüssel (Abrechnung nach Nutzung, jeder Text nur einmal)."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:224
msgid "Very good · free key available"
msgstr "Sehr gut · kostenloser Schlüssel erhältlich"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:224
msgid "Excellent for European languages. The DeepL API Free plan includes 500,000 characters per month."
msgstr "Ausgezeichnet für europäische Sprachen. Der Tarif DeepL API Free enthält 500'000 Zeichen pro Monat."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:225
msgid "AI · bring your own"
msgstr "KI · eigener Anbieter"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:225
msgid "Any OpenAI-compatible API: OpenAI, OpenRouter, Mistral, or a local Ollama / LM Studio server (no key needed locally)."
msgstr "Jede OpenAI-kompatible API: OpenAI, OpenRouter, Mistral oder ein lokaler Ollama-/LM-Studio-Server (lokal ohne Schlüssel)."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:226
msgid "Open source · self-hosted"
msgstr "Open Source · selbst gehostet"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:226
msgid "Your own LibreTranslate server. Nothing leaves your infrastructure."
msgstr "Ihr eigener LibreTranslate-Server. Nichts verlässt Ihre Infrastruktur."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:227
msgid "Free · small daily quota"
msgstr "Kostenlos · kleines Tageskontingent"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:227
msgid "Free translation memory service. Adding an e-mail address raises the quota to 50,000 characters per day."
msgstr "Kostenloser Translation-Memory-Dienst. Mit einer E-Mail-Adresse steigt das Kontingent auf 50'000 Zeichen pro Tag."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:246
msgid "Anthropic API key"
msgstr "Anthropic-API-Schlüssel"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:248
msgid "Create one at <a href=\"https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">console.anthropic.com</a>."
msgstr "Erstellen Sie einen unter <a href=\"https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">console.anthropic.com</a>."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:251
#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:288
#: includes/engines/class-openai.php:107
msgid "Model"
msgstr "Modell"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:258
msgid "claude-opus-5 gives the best copy; claude-sonnet-5 or claude-haiku-4-5 are faster and cheaper."
msgstr "claude-opus-5 liefert die besten Texte; claude-sonnet-5 oder claude-haiku-4-5 sind schneller und günstiger."

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:264
msgid "DeepL API key"
msgstr "DeepL-API-Schlüssel"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:266
